// Title: Potential Persistence Via AppCompat RegisterAppRestart Layer
// Rule ID: b86852fb-4c77-48f9-8519-eb1b2c308b59
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.011
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
